This is a fairly irregular contest held by the scifi/fantasy book review website fantasyliterature.com.&nbsp; The basic premise is that there are some books with really ugly/horrifying/bizarre covers, and we need to come up with titles for books that would actually match the cover.

&nbsp;

The game is fun, so I thought I&#39;d share it with all of you!&nbsp; Here is the [url=http://www.fantasyliterature.com/giveaway/thoughtful-thursday-rename-this-horrible-cover-7/]ongoing competition (mildly NSFW)[/url].&nbsp; I&#39;ve tried to come up with a name for this one, but I can&#39;t beat some of the ones already suggested.

&nbsp;

